"use strict";(Array.isArray(self.webpackChunkwoocommerce_multivendor_marketplace_docs)?self.webpackChunkwoocommerce_multivendor_marketplace_docs:self.webpackChunkwoocommerce_multivendor_marketplace_docs=[]).push([[6336],{87618(e,t,a){a.r(t),a.d(t,{comp:()=>d,data:()=>c});var i=a(20641);const r=a.p+"assets/img/admin-manage-feedback.49166c0e.webp",n=a.p+"assets/img/manage-feedback.c7856752.webp",s=a.p+"assets/img/manage-feedback-modal.d399ee6c.webp",o=a.p+"assets/img/manage-feedback-search-filter.eb20d056.webp",l={},d=(0,a(66262).A)(l,[["render",function(e,t){return(0,i.uX)(),(0,i.CE)("div",null,t[0]||(t[0]=[(0,i.Fv)('<h1 id="marketplace-reviews-ratings" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#marketplace-reviews-ratings"><span>Marketplace Reviews &amp; Ratings</span></a></h1><p>The <strong>Marketplace Reviews &amp; Ratings</strong> feature allows the admin to manage customer reviews and ratings submitted for vendor products across the marketplace.</p><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/admin-manage-feedback.webp"><img src="'+r+'" alt="Manage Feedback"></a></p><hr><h2 id="manage-customer-reviews-ratings" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#manage-customer-reviews-ratings"><span>Manage Customer Reviews &amp; Ratings</span></a></h2><p>The admin can review and control feedback submitted by customers for vendor products.</p><h3 id="key-features" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#key-features"><span>Key Features</span></a></h3><ul><li>Admin can <strong>approve or disapprove</strong>: <ul><li>Product reviews</li><li>Product ratings</li></ul></li><li>Only <strong>approved reviews and ratings</strong> are visible on the storefront.</li><li>Vendors can view approved customer feedback from their <strong>vendor dashboard</strong>.</li><li>Helps maintain review quality and build customer trust.</li></ul><h3 id="navigation-path" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#navigation-path"><span>Navigation Path</span></a></h3><ul><li><strong>Marketplace → Reviews &amp; Ratings</strong></li></ul><hr><h3 id="review-management-interface" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#review-management-interface"><span>Review Management Interface</span></a></h3><p>The review management section displays:</p><ul><li>Customer name</li><li>Vendor name</li><li>Product name</li><li>Rating</li><li>Review message</li><li>Approval status</li><li>Action options (Approve / Disapprove)</li></ul><p><strong>Reference Media:</strong></p><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/manage-feedback.webp"><img src="'+n+'" alt="Manage Feedback"></a></p><hr><h2 id="admin-navigation-access" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#admin-navigation-access"><span>Admin Navigation &amp; Access</span></a></h2><p>Marketplace administrators can access the feedback management console directly from the WordPress administration dashboard:</p><ul><li><strong>Menu Route</strong>: <strong>Marketplace → Reviews &amp; Rating</strong></li><li><strong>Screen Title</strong>: <strong>Manage Feedback</strong></li><li><strong>Direct Admin URL</strong>:<div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="prismjs" data-ext="text"><pre><code><span class="line">https://your-domain.com/wp-admin/admin.php?page=wk-marketplace-feedback</span>\n<span class="line"></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div></div></div></li><li><strong>User Access</strong>: Available to Marketplace Administrators and authorized Store Managers.</li></ul><div class="hint-container tip"><p class="hint-container-title">Fast Navigation</p><p>Bookmark the <strong>Reviews &amp; Rating</strong> page in your browser for quick access when conducting routine customer feedback moderation and vendor reputation audits.</p></div><hr><h2 id="multi-dimensional-rating-criteria-each-dimension-explained" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#multi-dimensional-rating-criteria-each-dimension-explained"><span>Multi-Dimensional Rating Criteria (Each Dimension Explained)</span></a></h2><p>Rather than relying on a single, generalized star rating, the WooCommerce Multi-Vendor Marketplace evaluates vendor reputation using a <strong>three-dimensional rating framework</strong>. When a customer submits a store review, they rate the vendor across three distinct performance aspects:</p><div class="language-text line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="prismjs" data-ext="text"><pre><code><span class="line">                          ┌───────────────────────────┐</span>\n<span class="line">                          │   Customer Store Review   │</span>\n<span class="line">                          └─────────────┬─────────────┘</span>\n<span class="line">                                        │</span>\n<span class="line">           ┌────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────┐</span>\n<span class="line">           ▼                            ▼                            ▼</span>\n<span class="line">  ┌─────────────────┐          ┌─────────────────┐          ┌─────────────────┐</span>\n<span class="line">  │  Price Rating   │          │  Value Rating   │          │ Quality Rating  │</span>\n<span class="line">  │     (1 to 5)    │          │     (1 to 5)    │          │     (1 to 5)    │</span>\n<span class="line">  └────────┬────────┘          └────────┬────────┘          └────────┬────────┘</span>\n<span class="line">           │                            │                            │</span>\n<span class="line">           └────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────┘</span>\n<span class="line">                                        ▼</span>\n<span class="line">                          ┌───────────────────────────┐</span>\n<span class="line">                          │   Overall Seller Score    │</span>\n<span class="line">                          │ (Price + Value + Quality) │</span>\n<span class="line">                          │ ───────────────────────── │</span>\n<span class="line">                          │             3             │</span>\n<span class="line">                          └───────────────────────────┘</span>\n<span class="line"></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0;"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><h3 id="_1-dimension-1-price-rating-price" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-dimension-1-price-rating-price"><span>1. Dimension 1: Price Rating (Price)</span></a></h3><ul><li><strong>Scoring Range</strong>: 1 to 5 Stars</li><li><strong>Evaluation Scope</strong>: Measures buyer satisfaction regarding pricing fairness, competitive rates, and affordability relative to comparable products on the marketplace.</li><li><strong>Admin Display</strong>: Rendered as a score out of 5 (e.g., <code>5/5</code>, <code>4/5</code>).</li></ul><h3 id="_2-dimension-2-value-rating-value" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-dimension-2-value-rating-value"><span>2. Dimension 2: Value Rating (Value)</span></a></h3><ul><li><strong>Scoring Range</strong>: 1 to 5 Stars</li><li><strong>Evaluation Scope</strong>: Measures the perceived value-for-money delivered by the vendor. It assesses whether the purchased goods fulfilled customer expectations for the price paid.</li><li><strong>Admin Display</strong>: Rendered as a score out of 5 (e.g., <code>5/5</code>, <code>4/5</code>).</li></ul><h3 id="_3-dimension-3-quality-rating-quality" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_3-dimension-3-quality-rating-quality"><span>3. Dimension 3: Quality Rating (Quality)</span></a></h3><ul><li><strong>Scoring Range</strong>: 1 to 5 Stars</li><li><strong>Evaluation Scope</strong>: Assesses product craftsmanship, material condition, packaging care, and match with the listed product description.</li><li><strong>Admin Display</strong>: Rendered as a score out of 5 (e.g., <code>5/5</code>, <code>3/5</code>).</li></ul><h3 id="overall-vendor-rating-calculation" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#overall-vendor-rating-calculation"><span>Overall Vendor Rating Calculation</span></a></h3><p>The marketplace calculates the vendor&#39;s overall storefront score by averaging all three approved criteria:</p><p>$$\\text{Overall Vendor Rating} = \\frac{\\text{Average Price} + \\text{Average Value} + \\text{Average Quality}}{3}$$</p><ul><li><strong>Automatic Recalculation</strong>: The overall score updates automatically whenever an administrator approves or disapproves reviews in the moderation queue.</li><li><strong>Storefront Display</strong>: The calculated average is presented as star graphics on the vendor&#39;s public store banner, vendor badge, and customer-facing store profile.</li></ul><hr><h2 id="review-management-table-columns-reference" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#review-management-table-columns-reference"><span>Review Management Table Columns &amp; Reference</span></a></h2><p>The <strong>Manage Feedback</strong> table organizes customer reviews into a clear, structured view. Below is a detailed breakdown of every column displayed on the screen:</p><table><thead><tr><th style="text-align:left;">Column Header</th><th style="text-align:left;">Display Format</th><th style="text-align:left;">Description &amp; Functional Behavior</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Checkbox</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Selection Checkbox</td><td style="text-align:left;">Selects one or more reviews for bulk actions (Approve, Disapprove, or Delete). Use the top header checkbox to select all reviews on the page.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Shop Name</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Hyperlinked Text</td><td style="text-align:left;">Displays the vendor&#39;s shop name and vendor ID (e.g., <strong>Aurora Athletics (#2)</strong>). Clicking the link opens the vendor details page. Displays <code>(Deleted Shop)</code> if the vendor account was removed.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Given By</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Customer Name</td><td style="text-align:left;">The name of the registered customer who submitted the review.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Value</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Score (<code>X/5</code>)</td><td style="text-align:left;">The star rating given for the store&#39;s value-for-money out of 5 stars.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Price</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Score (<code>X/5</code>)</td><td style="text-align:left;">The star rating given for pricing fairness and affordability out of 5 stars.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Quality</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Score (<code>X/5</code>)</td><td style="text-align:left;">The star rating given for product craftsmanship and packaging out of 5 stars.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Summary</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Text Headline</td><td style="text-align:left;">The short review title or headline summary entered by the customer (e.g., <em>&quot;Great maker to buy from&quot;</em>, <em>&quot;Will order again&quot;</em>).</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Description</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Text + Preview Link</td><td style="text-align:left;">The detailed customer feedback text. Longer messages show a <strong><code>... See More</code></strong> link to view the complete comments in a popup window.</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Status</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Status Badge</td><td style="text-align:left;">The current review status:<br>• <strong>Approved</strong>: Published live on the vendor&#39;s public shop profile.<br>• <strong>Disapproved</strong>: Hidden from public view; does not affect the seller&#39;s score.<br>• <strong>Pending</strong>: Newly submitted review awaiting admin moderation.<br><em>(Click the column header to sort reviews by status).</em></td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Date Created</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Date &amp; Time</td><td style="text-align:left;">The date and time when the customer submitted the review (e.g., <code>August 10, 2026 10:26 am</code>). <em>(Click the column header to sort reviews chronologically).</em></td></tr></tbody></table><hr><h2 id="detailed-review-inspection-modal-preview" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#detailed-review-inspection-modal-preview"><span>Detailed Review Inspection (Modal Preview)</span></a></h2><p>To keep the table easy to read and browse, customer review descriptions are presented cleanly:</p><ul><li><strong>Short Reviews (10 words or fewer)</strong>: Display in full directly inside the <strong>Description</strong> column.</li><li><strong>Longer Reviews (more than 10 words)</strong>: Automatically truncate with a <strong><code>... See More</code></strong> link.</li></ul><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/manage-feedback-modal.webp"><img src="'+s+'" alt="Review Description Modal Preview"></a></p><h3 id="how-the-preview-works" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#how-the-preview-works"><span>How the Preview Works</span></a></h3><ol><li>Click <strong><code>... See More</code></strong> on any truncated review.</li><li>A popup window opens directly on your screen titled <strong>&quot;Review Description&quot;</strong>.</li><li>Read the complete, unabridged customer commentary to verify compliance with store guidelines without leaving the page or losing your place.</li><li>Close the window using the <kbd>✕</kbd> button or by pressing <kbd>Esc</kbd>.</li></ol><hr><h2 id="searching-sorting-and-filtering-feedback" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#searching-sorting-and-filtering-feedback"><span>Searching, Sorting, and Filtering Feedback</span></a></h2><p>The feedback screen includes search and sorting tools to help administrators quickly find and manage customer reviews:</p><p><a class="doc-image-link" href="./assets/manage-feedback-search-filter.webp"><img src="'+o+'" alt="Feedback Search and Filters"></a></p><h3 id="_1-keyword-search-by-summary" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-keyword-search-by-summary"><span>1. Keyword Search by Summary</span></a></h3><p>Located in the upper-right corner of the table:</p><ul><li><strong>Search Box</strong>: Type keywords into the <strong>Search By Summary</strong> field (such as <em>&quot;quality&quot;</em>, <em>&quot;shipping&quot;</em>, or <em>&quot;service&quot;</em>).</li><li><strong>Find Results</strong>: Click <strong>Search</strong> to filter the list and display only reviews containing those terms in their headline summary.</li></ul><h3 id="_2-status-column-sorting" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-status-column-sorting"><span>2. Status Column Sorting</span></a></h3><p>The <strong>Status</strong> column header is interactive:</p><ul><li>Click <strong>Status</strong> to group and sort reviews by approval state (<strong>Approved</strong>, <strong>Disapproved</strong>, or <strong>Pending</strong>).</li><li>Clicking again reverses the order, making it easy to bring all pending reviews to the top for quick moderation.</li></ul><h3 id="_3-date-created-sorting" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_3-date-created-sorting"><span>3. Date Created Sorting</span></a></h3><p>The <strong>Date Created</strong> column header is interactive:</p><ul><li>Click <strong>Date Created</strong> to switch between newest-first and oldest-first view.</li><li>This helps you quickly inspect the latest incoming customer feedback or check older records.</li></ul><hr><h2 id="bulk-moderation-workflow-administrative-actions" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#bulk-moderation-workflow-administrative-actions"><span>Bulk Moderation Workflow &amp; Administrative Actions</span></a></h2><p>Administrators can moderate reviews individually or in batches using the bulk action menu.</p><h3 id="step-by-step-moderation-procedure" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#step-by-step-moderation-procedure"><span>Step-by-Step Moderation Procedure</span></a></h3><ol><li><strong>Select Reviews</strong>: Check the boxes next to the reviews you want to moderate, or click the header checkbox to select all visible rows.</li><li><strong>Choose Action</strong>: Open the <strong>Bulk actions</strong> dropdown selector at the top or bottom of the table: <ul><li><strong>Approve</strong>: Approves selected reviews. Approved reviews appear immediately on the vendor&#39;s storefront profile and contribute to their average rating.</li><li><strong>Disapprove</strong>: Disapproves selected reviews. Disapproved reviews are hidden from the storefront and excluded from the vendor&#39;s public rating.</li><li><strong>Delete</strong>: Permanently removes selected reviews from your marketplace.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Apply</strong>: Click the <strong>Apply</strong> button next to the dropdown menu.</li></ol><h3 id="system-notices" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#system-notices"><span>System Notices</span></a></h3><p>The screen displays a clear confirmation notice after each action:</p><table><thead><tr><th style="text-align:left;">Action Taken</th><th style="text-align:left;">Notice Style</th><th style="text-align:left;">Confirmation Message</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Reviews Approved</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Success (Green)</td><td style="text-align:left;"><code>Feedback has been approved successfully.</code></td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Reviews Disapproved</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Success (Green)</td><td style="text-align:left;"><code>Feedback has been disapproved successfully.</code></td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>Reviews Deleted</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Success (Green)</td><td style="text-align:left;"><code>Feedback has been deleted successfully.</code></td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>No Rows Selected</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">Alert (Red)</td><td style="text-align:left;"><code>Please select atleast one feedback.</code></td></tr></tbody></table><div class="hint-container warning"><p class="hint-container-title">Permanent Action</p><p>Deleting a review permanently removes it from your marketplace and cannot be undone. If you only want to hide a review from customers, choose <strong>Disapprove</strong> instead.</p></div><hr><h2 id="storefront-seller-integration-flow" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#storefront-seller-integration-flow"><span>Storefront &amp; Seller Integration Flow</span></a></h2><p>Customer feedback submitted across the marketplace connects the storefront and vendor experience:</p><h3 id="_1-customer-review-submission" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-customer-review-submission"><span>1. Customer Review Submission</span></a></h3><ul><li>Customers visit the vendor&#39;s public store profile on the marketplace storefront.</li><li>Under the <strong>Write your review</strong> section, buyers rate their experience: <ul><li>Choose 1 to 5 stars for <strong>Price</strong>.</li><li>Choose 1 to 5 stars for <strong>Value</strong>.</li><li>Choose 1 to 5 stars for <strong>Quality</strong>.</li><li>Add a short review <strong>Summary</strong>.</li><li>Enter full feedback comments in the review <strong>Description</strong>.</li></ul></li><li>Once submitted, the review enters your admin moderation list with <strong>Pending</strong> status.</li></ul><h3 id="_2-moderation-gatekeeper" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-moderation-gatekeeper"><span>2. Moderation Gatekeeper</span></a></h3><ul><li>Customer reviews remain hidden from the public store until approved.</li><li>Only reviews approved by the administrator appear on the vendor&#39;s public <strong>Shop Reviews</strong> tab.</li></ul><h3 id="_3-vendor-dashboard-visibility" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_3-vendor-dashboard-visibility"><span>3. Vendor Dashboard Visibility</span></a></h3><ul><li>Vendors can view their approved customer reviews directly from their <strong>Vendor Dashboard</strong>.</li><li>Vendors cannot edit or remove customer feedback, keeping ratings honest, balanced, and transparent.</li><li>High star ratings build buyer trust and help vendors grow their store reputation.</li></ul><hr><h2 id="best-practices-for-feedback-moderation" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#best-practices-for-feedback-moderation"><span>Best Practices for Feedback Moderation</span></a></h2><p>To maintain a credible and trustworthy multi-vendor marketplace:</p><ol><li><strong>Review Regularly</strong>: Check the feedback moderation screen regularly so genuine customer reviews are published without long delays.</li><li><strong>Stay Fair and Objective</strong>: Only disapprove reviews that violate marketplace rules (such as spam, offensive language, or false claims). Honest customer opinions help shoppers make better buying choices.</li><li><strong>Monitor Low Scores</strong>: If a vendor consistently receives low scores in Price or Quality, reach out to help them improve their products, pricing, or shipping standards.</li><li><strong>Boost Store Visibility</strong>: Verified reviews provide helpful details for shoppers and boost search engine visibility for vendor stores.</li></ol><hr><h2 id="summary-–-marketplace-reviews-ratings" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#summary-–-marketplace-reviews-ratings"><span>Summary – Marketplace Reviews &amp; Ratings</span></a></h2><ul><li>Centralized control over customer reviews and ratings</li><li>Approval-based visibility ensures quality content</li><li>Vendors can view feedback related to their products</li><li>Improves marketplace transparency and credibility</li></ul><hr>',85)]))}]]),c=JSON.parse('{"path":"/documentation/manage-feedback-and-vendor-queries.html","title":"Marketplace Reviews & Ratings – Admin Guide","lang":"en-US","frontmatter":{"title":"Marketplace Reviews & Ratings – Admin Guide","description":"Complete user guide for managing vendor reviews and customer feedback in WooCommerce Multi-Vendor Marketplace. Moderate customer ratings across Price, Value, and Quality dimensions, filter by summary, sort statuses, inspect reviews with modal previews, and execute bulk moderation actions.","head":[["meta",{"name":"keywords","content":"woocommerce marketplace reviews, manage vendor feedback, marketplace ratings, vendor review moderation, marketplace feedback dimensions, price value quality rating, bulk approve reviews, woocommerce multivendor feedback, customer store review"}],["meta",{"property":"og:title","content":"Marketplace Reviews & Ratings – Admin Guide | WooCommerce Multi-Vendor Marketplace"}],["meta",{"property":"og:description","content":"Learn how to moderate vendor reviews, inspect multi-dimensional feedback (Price, Value, Quality), filter and search feedback summaries, and execute bulk approvals in WooCommerce Multi-Vendor Marketplace."}],["meta",{"property":"og:type","content":"article"}]]},"headers":[{"level":2,"title":"Manage Customer Reviews & Ratings","slug":"manage-customer-reviews-ratings","link":"#manage-customer-reviews-ratings","children":[{"level":3,"title":"Key Features","slug":"key-features","link":"#key-features","children":[]},{"level":3,"title":"Navigation Path","slug":"navigation-path","link":"#navigation-path","children":[]},{"level":3,"title":"Review Management Interface","slug":"review-management-interface","link":"#review-management-interface","children":[]}]},{"level":2,"title":"Admin Navigation & Access","slug":"admin-navigation-access","link":"#admin-navigation-access","children":[]},{"level":2,"title":"Multi-Dimensional Rating Criteria (Each Dimension Explained)","slug":"multi-dimensional-rating-criteria-each-dimension-explained","link":"#multi-dimensional-rating-criteria-each-dimension-explained","children":[{"level":3,"title":"1. Dimension 1: Price Rating (Price)","slug":"_1-dimension-1-price-rating-price","link":"#_1-dimension-1-price-rating-price","children":[]},{"level":3,"title":"2. Dimension 2: Value Rating (Value)","slug":"_2-dimension-2-value-rating-value","link":"#_2-dimension-2-value-rating-value","children":[]},{"level":3,"title":"3. Dimension 3: Quality Rating (Quality)","slug":"_3-dimension-3-quality-rating-quality","link":"#_3-dimension-3-quality-rating-quality","children":[]},{"level":3,"title":"Overall Vendor Rating Calculation","slug":"overall-vendor-rating-calculation","link":"#overall-vendor-rating-calculation","children":[]}]},{"level":2,"title":"Review Management Table Columns & Reference","slug":"review-management-table-columns-reference","link":"#review-management-table-columns-reference","children":[]},{"level":2,"title":"Detailed Review Inspection (Modal Preview)","slug":"detailed-review-inspection-modal-preview","link":"#detailed-review-inspection-modal-preview","children":[{"level":3,"title":"How the Preview Works","slug":"how-the-preview-works","link":"#how-the-preview-works","children":[]}]},{"level":2,"title":"Searching, Sorting, and Filtering Feedback","slug":"searching-sorting-and-filtering-feedback","link":"#searching-sorting-and-filtering-feedback","children":[{"level":3,"title":"1. Keyword Search by Summary","slug":"_1-keyword-search-by-summary","link":"#_1-keyword-search-by-summary","children":[]},{"level":3,"title":"2. Status Column Sorting","slug":"_2-status-column-sorting","link":"#_2-status-column-sorting","children":[]},{"level":3,"title":"3. Date Created Sorting","slug":"_3-date-created-sorting","link":"#_3-date-created-sorting","children":[]}]},{"level":2,"title":"Bulk Moderation Workflow & Administrative Actions","slug":"bulk-moderation-workflow-administrative-actions","link":"#bulk-moderation-workflow-administrative-actions","children":[{"level":3,"title":"Step-by-Step Moderation Procedure","slug":"step-by-step-moderation-procedure","link":"#step-by-step-moderation-procedure","children":[]},{"level":3,"title":"System Notices","slug":"system-notices","link":"#system-notices","children":[]}]},{"level":2,"title":"Storefront & Seller Integration Flow","slug":"storefront-seller-integration-flow","link":"#storefront-seller-integration-flow","children":[{"level":3,"title":"1. Customer Review Submission","slug":"_1-customer-review-submission","link":"#_1-customer-review-submission","children":[]},{"level":3,"title":"2. Moderation Gatekeeper","slug":"_2-moderation-gatekeeper","link":"#_2-moderation-gatekeeper","children":[]},{"level":3,"title":"3. Vendor Dashboard Visibility","slug":"_3-vendor-dashboard-visibility","link":"#_3-vendor-dashboard-visibility","children":[]}]},{"level":2,"title":"Best Practices for Feedback Moderation","slug":"best-practices-for-feedback-moderation","link":"#best-practices-for-feedback-moderation","children":[]},{"level":2,"title":"Summary – Marketplace Reviews & Ratings","slug":"summary-–-marketplace-reviews-ratings","link":"#summary-–-marketplace-reviews-ratings","children":[]}],"git":{},"filePathRelative":"documentation/manage-feedback-and-vendor-queries.md"}')}}]);